WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.860
And Ohio Zoo is asking the public to name its newborn baby rhino.

00:04.400 --> 00:07.920
You know, ABC did the same thing after they adopted five new dairy cows.

00:11.800 --> 00:12.880
Never fails.

00:13.440 --> 00:14.060
Why stop?

00:16.380 --> 00:23.240
J.B. Pritzker says President Trump deploying troops to Chicago is due to his obsessive fixations.

00:23.960 --> 00:27.080
Yeah, this from the guy who every time he steps on a crack, he has to eat a pizza.

